					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-90283#post-4539780</guid>
				<title>Image provenance</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-90283/scp-268#post-4539780</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 10 Mar 2020 03:59:32 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Voct</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>392303</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Tineye pointed to a dead page on Kaboodle.com</p> <p>which was on the Wayback machine</p> <p>where I found that the page in question was <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20071017160915/http://www.kaboodle.com/ling67/what-im-wishing-for.html">a wish list of neat things for sale in 2007</a>. The images are dead, but this description -</p> <blockquote> <p>Tweed newsboy cap: Inspired by a vintage newsboy-style cap we found in an Irish village, in patterned wool tweed. Self-fabric strap across front brim of hat with leather-covered buckle detail. Cotton poplin lining. Grosgrain polka-dot sweatband. Import.</p> </blockquote> <p>links to a (dead) catalogue entry at JCrew.com. Obvious conclusion: this picture was taken from a JCrew catalogue, and is not available under a suitable license.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
